; Like beancount, a duplicate open is reported and its currencies replace the
; first open's for every posting to the account.
2019-01-01 open Assets:Bank
2019-01-01 open Income:Salary CAD
2019-01-01 open Income:Salary USD

2019-02-01 * "posting in the second open's currency"
  Assets:Bank     1000.00 USD
  Income:Salary  -1000.00 USD

2019-02-02 * "posting in the first open's currency"
  Assets:Bank     1000.00 CAD
  Income:Salary  -1000.00 CAD
